$ gh-user-attachments auth --help
exit 0
--- stdout (empty) ---
--- stderr ---
Manage the GitHub web session used for native attachment upload.
Usage:
  gh-user-attachments auth login            Sign in via a tool-owned Chrome window (CDP) and store the session as a 0600 file
  gh-user-attachments auth status           Show whether a usable session is configured
  gh-user-attachments auth logout           Delete the stored session and tool-owned Chrome profile residue
